{"content_hash": "5943bd7dcbc3894f", "version_id": 962, "article_id": 97, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "OnePlus launches Ace 7 Pro with a new zoom camera", "title_zh": "一加发布Ace 7 Pro，新增长焦镜头", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1165/1165652.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567019001814-57350903e2af?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8YWNlJTIwcHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ2MjAwMTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Jason Abrams on Unsplash", "author": "Jason Abrams", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jabrams5?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-green-golf-ball-sitting-on-top-of-a-green-field-EN3AVjMPZWA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(124, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(162, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "8fec7547c198"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-14", "word_count": 135, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "OnePlus has a new phone called the Ace 7 Pro. It is the most complete phone in the Ace family so far. The company fixed two old weak points: speed and photos.", "lead_zh": "一加推出了新手机Ace 7 Pro，这是Ace系列目前最全面的一款。公司补上了两个老短板：性能和拍照。", "preview": "The Ace 7 Pro uses a full flagship chip, the Snapdragon 8 Gen 5. It has a top speed of 4.6GHz. Two fans keep the phone cool, so games can ru", "preview_zh": "Ace 7 Pro搭载满血版旗舰芯片骁龙8第五代，最高频率达到4.6GHz。两个风扇帮助手机散热，游戏可以更久地保持185帧运行。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 950, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/97/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 50.575, "size_bytes": 304416, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 161, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@959f3ce/content/data/versions/962.json", "paragraphs": ["The Ace 7 Pro uses a full flagship chip, the Snapdragon 8 Gen 5. It has a top speed of 4.6GHz. Two fans keep the phone cool, so games can run at 185 frames per second for longer.", "For photos, the phone has a 200-megapixel main camera. It also adds a 50-megapixel zoom lens with 3.5x power. This is the first time an Ace phone has this kind of lens.", "The screen is 185Hz, and the battery is 9000mAh. The phone charges fully in 49 minutes with 100W fast charging. In tests, the battery lasted more than 15 hours.", "The phone comes in a black colour with a matte back. A small light near the cameras adds a gaming feel. OnePlus says the Ace 7 Pro is now better for games and for everyday use."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Ace 7 Pro搭载满血版旗舰芯片骁龙8第五代，最高频率达到4.6GHz。两个风扇帮助手机散热，游戏可以更久地保持185帧运行。", "拍照方面，这款手机有2亿像素主摄，还加入了一颗5000万像素、3.5倍变焦的长焦镜头。这是Ace系列第一次用上这种镜头。", "屏幕为185Hz，电池为9000mAh。手机支持100W快充，49分钟就能充满。实测续航超过15小时。", "手机有黑色版本，背面是磨砂质感。镜头附近的小灯带有一点电竞感。一加表示，Ace 7 Pro现在打游戏和日常使用都更好了。"], "body": "The Ace 7 Pro uses a full flagship chip, the Snapdragon 8 Gen 5. It has a top speed of 4.6GHz. Two fans keep the phone cool, so games can run at 185 frames per second for longer.\n\nFor photos, the phone has a 200-megapixel main camera. It also adds a 50-megapixel zoom lens with 3.5x power. This is the first time an Ace phone has this kind of lens.\n\nThe screen is 185Hz, and the battery is 9000mAh. The phone charges fully in 49 minutes with 100W fast charging. In tests, the battery lasted more than 15 hours.\n\nThe phone comes in a black colour with a matte back. A small light near the cameras adds a gaming feel. OnePlus says the Ace 7 Pro is now better for games and for everyday use.", "body_zh": "Ace 7 Pro搭载满血版旗舰芯片骁龙8第五代，最高频率达到4.6GHz。两个风扇帮助手机散热，游戏可以更久地保持185帧运行。\n\n拍照方面，这款手机有2亿像素主摄，还加入了一颗5000万像素、3.5倍变焦的长焦镜头。这是Ace系列第一次用上这种镜头。\n\n屏幕为185Hz，电池为9000mAh。手机支持100W快充，49分钟就能充满。实测续航超过15小时。\n\n手机有黑色版本，背面是磨砂质感。镜头附近的小灯带有一点电竞感。一加表示，Ace 7 Pro现在打游戏和日常使用都更好了。", "text": "The Ace 7 Pro uses a full flagship chip, the Snapdragon 8 Gen 5. It has a top speed of 4.6GHz. Two fans keep the phone cool, so games can run at 185 frames per second for longer. For photos, the phone has a 200-megapixel main camera. It also adds a 50-megapixel zoom lens with 3.5x power. This is the first time an Ace phone has this kind of lens. The screen is 185Hz, and the battery is 9000mAh. The phone charges fully in 49 minutes with 100W fast charging. In tests, the battery lasted more than 15 hours. The phone comes in a black colour with a matte back. A small light near the cameras adds a gaming feel. OnePlus says the Ace 7 Pro is now better for games and for everyday use.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常用来讲新手机、新产品上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "flagship", "pos": "adj", "zh": "旗舰级的", "note": "指同品牌里最高端的型号", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "chip", "pos": "noun", "zh": "芯片", "note": "手机性能的核心部件", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fan", "pos": "noun", "zh": "风扇", "note": "这里指手机内部的散热风扇", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "zoom lens", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "长焦镜头；变焦镜头", "note": "用来拍远处的东西", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "battery", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电池", "note": "常用搭配：battery life 续航", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charge", "pos": "verb", "zh": "充电", "note": "charge fully 充满电", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "matte", "pos": "adj", "zh": "磨砂的", "note": "形容背面不反光的质感", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T01:33:28.391504", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.4, "sm": 275, "em": 400, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Ace", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.625, "sm": 400, "em": 625, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "7", "s": 0.625, "e": 0.95, "sm": 625, "em": 949, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Pro", "s": 0.95, "e": 1.25, "sm": 950, "em": 1250, "cs": 10, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "uses", "s": 1.25, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1250, "em": 1550, "cs": 14, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, 